OL,3,GNEWSAGMP chief: G20 summit could 'bend
OL,4,Aus out of shape'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreater Manchester's chief constable
OL,7,Fsaid hosting the G20 summit in 2027
OL,8,Fwill be a "vast policing operation"
OL,9,Fthat will put pressure on resources.
OL,11,FSpeaking to BBC Radio Manchester's
OL,12,FHotseat programme, Sir Stephen Watson
OL,13,Fsaid the event would "bring pressures"
OL,14,Fand added: "If we're not careful, it
OL,15,Fcould sadly bend us out of shape."
OL,17,FHe said the international gathering
OL,18,Fwould provide an opportunity to
OL,19,Fshowcase the city on the world stage,
OL,20,Fbut require a significant commitment of
OL,21,Fofficers and resources.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
